## 🕹️ Controls Guide

| Action | Keyboard | Touch Screen / Mouse |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Main Action** *(Kick / Throw / Shoot)* | `Spacebar`, `Enter`, or `Up Arrow` | Tap Giant Center **"KICK! / THROW! / SHOOT!"** Button OR tap directly on the Game Canvas |
| **Aim / Move Left** | `Left Arrow` or `A` | Tap Big **⬅️ Left Arrow** Button |
| **Aim / Move Right** | `Right Arrow` or `D` | Tap Big **➡️ Right Arrow** Button |
| **Toggle Sound** | Click Sound Button in top bar | Tap **🔊 Sound ON/OFF** Button |
| **Return to Menu** | Click Menu Button in top bar | Tap **🏠 Menu** Button |

---

## 🚀 How to Run the Game

1. Save the `index.html` file to your computer.
2. Double-click `index.html` (or open it with any modern web browser like Chrome, Safari, Firefox, or Edge).
3. Choose a sport from the main menu and start playing!

---

## 🛠️ Technical Stack

- **HTML5**: Game structural layout and responsive canvas integration.
- **Tailwind CSS**: Modern utility-first styling for UI overlays, animated HUD headers, and big touch controls.
- **JavaScript (Vanilla ES6)**: 60 FPS Canvas rendering loop, custom physics engine, particle effects, and game state management.
- **Web Audio API**: Real-time sound synthesis engine.
